      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  ONE FORM TODAY                              WHAT EACH DEVICE ACTUALLY OFFERS\n  ──────────────────────────────              ─────────────────────────────────────\n  the raw TTY grid, everywhere                 desktop              phone\n  ┌────────────────────────────┐              ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n  │ 87 cols x 29 rows          │              │ ~87 columns  │    │ ~46 columns  │\n  │ claude's box art fits      │              │ hardware kbd │    │ IME keyboard │\n  │ input via hidden textarea  │              │ hover + mouse│    │ thumb, no    │\n  │ hover pre-warms the assets │              │ stays open   │    │ hover at all │\n  └────────────────────────────┘              └──────────────┘    │ SUSPENDED on │\n             │                                        ▲           │ every switch │\n             ├── drawn for this ──────────────────────┘           └──────────────┘\n             └── and handed unchanged to this ────────────────────────────▲",
      "originalText": "  ONE FORM TODAY                              WHAT EACH DEVICE ACTUALLY OFFERS\n  ──────────────────────────────              ─────────────────────────────────────\n  the raw TTY grid, everywhere                 desktop              phone\n  ┌────────────────────────────┐              ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n  │ 87 cols x 29 rows          │              │ ~87 columns  │    │ ~46 columns  │\n  │ claude's box art fits      │              │ hardware kbd │    │ IME keyboard │\n  │ input via hidden textarea  │              │ hover + mouse│    │ thumb, no    │\n  │ hover pre-warms the assets │              │ stays open   │    │ hover at all │\n  └────────────────────────────┘              └──────────────┘    │ SUSPENDED on │\n             │                                        ▲           │ every switch │\n             ├── drawn for this ──────────────────────┘           └──────────────┘\n             └── and handed unchanged to this ────────────────────────────▲",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
