      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786583077522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "┌ me, in this conversation ┐  a head full of things not in SKILL.md\n└──────────────────────────┘  → self-testing reveals nothing     ✗\n\n┌ fresh agent ┐  given only SKILL.md + one real topic\n└──────┬──────┘\n       ▼\n   it opens a board on its own\n       │\n   compare: did its steps match the design?\n       ├─ match     → pass\n       └─ mismatch  → fix SKILL.md, run again  ⟲",
      "originalText": "┌ me, in this conversation ┐  a head full of things not in SKILL.md\n└──────────────────────────┘  → self-testing reveals nothing     ✗\n\n┌ fresh agent ┐  given only SKILL.md + one real topic\n└──────┬──────┘\n       ▼\n   it opens a board on its own\n       │\n   compare: did its steps match the design?\n       ├─ match     → pass\n       └─ mismatch  → fix SKILL.md, run again  ⟲",
      "fontSize": 12,
